      "RADHA: Let’s pick up next week.\nROSA: What up, Miss B?\nRADHA: Don’t ‘Miss B’ me. The Dean said I should kick you BOTH out my class.\nRADHA: Fine.",
      "SNAZZY: You Forty yet?\nRADHA: Not ma’am, not yet.\nSNAZZY: Still trying that rapping shit?\nRADHA: Yes, Ma’am."
