        "speaker": 10,
        "line": 718,
        "text": "Okay! Not a bad ending. I woulda had a bit more sex in there but hey, life’s interesting. I know cause I done lived it. Yes! Been all over this here United States. Had many lovers, interesting jobs, like coat check girl at the Savoy. Hell I even ran some numbers."
